    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17290" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτύλωτος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ-</span> euph.) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>made
				callous by labour, hardened,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦμοι</span>”
